---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import skillicons from "../images/skillicons.svg";
---

<Layout title="about">
	<div class="text-ctp-text flex flex-col gap-2.5 leading-relaxed">
		<p class="text-lg font-semibold">
			hey there, i'm <span id="cxntered">cxntered</span>!! 👋
		</p>
		<p>i'm a self-taught full-stack developer who picked up programming for fun back in 2020.</p>
		<p>
			i originally started with bots in discord.js, but have since learnt a variety of different programming
			languages (which you can see below!!)
		</p>
		<p>i've also personally adminned/modded/developed for various decently sized content creators! :o</p>
		<p>
			outside of programming, i enjoy playing games across lots of genres, including shooters, action, adventure,
			rpgs, sandbox, rhythm, and more.
		</p>
	</div>
	<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
		<h2 class="text-ctp-red">## skills</h2>
		<!-- taken from skillicons.dev -->
		<Image
			src={skillicons}
			alt="javascript, typescript, nodejs, html, css, react, java, kotlin, python, go, astro"
			class="self-start"
			height="40"
		/>
	</div>
	<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
		<!-- oshi marks :3 -->
		<h2 class="text-ctp-red">## "emojis"</h2>
		<p class="text-ctp-text text-2xl">🐾👧🍵🗿⏳💜</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
